        "PMC12348563::web::021::3_4_microstructure_and_chemical_composit"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coarser intermetallic or second-phase morphology is associated with greater intergranular corrosion and reduced corrosion performance.",
